# Clean Up and Push to Remote Git

```cmd id="final1"
:: STEP 1 - Go to project folder
cd Desktop
cd "06-Week 6"
cd "Git-HOL "

:: STEP 2 - Check current status (clean state)
git status

:: STEP 3 - List all branches
git branch

:: STEP 4 - Switch to main branch
git checkout main

:: STEP 5 - Pull latest changes from remote
git pull origin main

:: STEP 6 - Add all changes
git add .

:: STEP 7 - Commit changes
git commit -m "Cleanup and push changes"

:: STEP 8 - Push to remote repository
git push origin main

:: STEP 9 - Verify status
git status

:: STEP 10 - Check commit history
git log --oneline --graph --decorate
```
